WEBVTT

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:05.750
This is the place?

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.450
Only inn for miles.

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.150
Someone's alive.

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:14.350
Where is everyone?

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:17.150
Not here.

00:00:20.650 --> 00:00:23.650
We have a bit of a conjurer situation
on our hands.

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:27.300
I figured, why not fight fire with fire?

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:31.450
And lay low until the right opportunity arrives.

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:39.000
I take it back.

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:40.050
What?

00:00:40.450 --> 00:00:42.100
Outside was nicer.
